 Deck's screen: The game's widescreen layout was designed around the Deck's native1280×800 display, so it fills the screen with no black bars. The HUD sits in the corners, out of theway of the room you're fighting in.Full controller support, no setup: Movement","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397376","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5062020-1843481262693104","game_id":"steam-5062020","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to House of the Lost: Revived","summary":"Hello, Steam! We're F5 Games, a small indie studio from the heart of Tornado Alley, and we'd like to tell you about our game, one that's been trying to find a home platform for more than a decade.House of the Lost: Revived is a top-down action roguelike that blends the chaotic fun of The Binding of Isaac with the dungeon-crawling charm of classic Zelda. Your sister has disappeared into the House, and the only way to get her back is to go in after her with a slingshot and a lot of nerve. Every ru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T18:11:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693104","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:24:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5062020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5062020":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5062020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z"},"5297690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:57:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5062020","app_id":5062020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"bce2abfa28984bea39f3be5a61b6358c8b7747cbd386c1be458cc82e862cfc39","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"House of the Lost: Revived is a top-down action roguelike built for players who grew up clearing rooms, dodging traps, and learning from every death. Each run is a new house, a new build, and a new chance to craft absurd weapons and get a little further before the House gets you.","publishers":[{"name":"F5 Games LLC"}],"developers":[{"name":"F5 Games LLC"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793430000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"House of the Lost Revived - Announcement Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791509498","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5062020/616805954/8162e4913ab04ac59f99d34d1013f7a7b5c5fa1f/1787005982/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5062020/616805954/8162e4913ab04ac59f99d34d1013f7a7b5c5fa1f/1787005982/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"5062020/616805954/8162e4913ab04ac59f99d34d1013f7a7b5c5fa1f/1787005982/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"5062020/616805954/8162e4913ab04ac59f99d34d1013f7a7b5c5fa1f/1787005982/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"5062020/616805954/8162e4913ab04ac59f99d34d1013f7a7b5c5fa1f/1787005982/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257401809/d6b0f83d205449bfed478e24606c5c132cd3ef0c/m